{"id":"vod_sn_36450","vodId":"36450","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"增血鬼果林","name_cn":"增血鬼果林","date":"2005-01-01","year":"2005","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/a69590fa1ef6b6592ca78267c2541026.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在现代日本，真红果林（矢作纱友里 配音）出生在一个古老的吸血鬼家族之中，可是，和家族中其他的成员不同，真红不但不需要吸血，她体内的血还会增加，这令真红感到十分困扰。外表强悍但其实是个妻管严的爸爸亨利（松本大 配音）、喜欢吸食嗜谎者血液的妈妈莲拉（筱原惠美 配音）、绝不吸食男人血液的哥哥炼（诹访部顺一 配音）、沉默寡言的妹妹杏树（猪口有佳 配音），真红一家人虽然都是吸血鬼，却和普通的家庭没有什么两样。　　因为自己的特殊体质，真红常常遭到同类的嘲笑。某日，真红班上新来了一位名叫雨水健太（小西克幸 配音）的转校生，健太的出现让真红的生活发生了翻天覆地的变化。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:43:18","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/yUWWuwHSqt1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/QvPDUPH3c51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/9AsZJzYUVp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/1C8L7BKam71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/yJ2pizjGdj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/4r1W6k1kpF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/U7KBvqFkVJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/v3Le71jz1P1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/aTW7s2vtPq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/RfEbZ5x6e91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HAVyBargQw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/WBFFmgd4T21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/gzYCQgkV9Q1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/2h3Q1XYQb01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","u